<h1 class="doc-h1">FAQ Section</h1>
<p class="doc-lede">
    ScrollX UI's frequently-asked-questions section: a headline that arrives word by word out of a
    blur, a line of help with a support address, and the questions as an accordion whose rows rise
    into place one after another the first time the section is scrolled into view.
</p>

